{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is approached, then take it and check its properties, otherwise approach and scan it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = MoveRobot    />\"",
